      "briefTitle": "Study of Olatorepatide in Adult Participants Living With Overweight or Obesity Without Diabetes",
      "officialTitle": "A Phase 2, Randomized, Placebo-Controlled Study to Assess the Safety, Tolerability, Pharmacokinetics, and Efficacy of Olatorepatide, a GLP-1/GIP Receptor Agonist, With Different Doses and Drug-Titration Algorithms in Participants Living With Overweight or Obesity"
